	(text "Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-4.3B (own ESP32-S3, 800 x 480, 7-36 V in, about 2.3 W): telemetry and commands over CAN (its TJA1051T/3 on GPIO15 / GPIO16, 120 R by switch)."
