	(text "DO0 / DO1 on the Waveshare display are NPN open collectors to its ground (PC817 + transistor, 100 nF to GND): DO0 presses PWR_BTN like SW3, DO1 pulls ESP_EN low like the RESET button."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "49b6d8a1-2619-59af-bf78-1d949a6b2653")
	)
	(text "Its two digital outputs press the power button and RESET through J21: global labels PWR_BTN (Power Button sheet) and ESP_EN (MCU sheet)."
